<title>USA: China Yuchai sees difficult market in 1997.</title>
<headline>China Yuchai sees difficult market in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Yuchai International Ltd said Thursday it expects difficult market conditions experienced in 1996 to continue in 1997.</p>
<p>China Yuchai reported a loss of 2.02 renminbi (Chinese yuan), or US$0.24, per share for 1996.</p>
<p>The company said it expects selling prices to continue to be under pressure as more models that are competitive to Yuchai models are launched.</p>
<p>It said demand from some major customers is uncertain.</p>
</text>
